  "title": "Wikitree Selects DeeperDive From Taboola, Gen AI Answer Engine Built for the Open Web, to Connect Readers with Timely, Contextual Answers for Topics They Care About",
  "summary": "New York, NY – Taboola (NASDAQ: TBLA) today announced that Wikitree has selected DeeperDive, a Gen AI answer engine that lives directly on publisher websites and leverages their own content. As part of the agreement, Wikitree will use DeeperDive to increase readership and engagement, while also opening additional revenue streams. As a cornerstone of Taboola’s […]",
